    Then from this $Phi: sqrt(r) DD^d -> cal(l)^2 (NN_0^d)$
    $ Phi(z) = ( (a_(j_1+...+j_d) c_(j_1,...,j_d))^(1/2) product_(i=1)^d overline(xi)_i^(j_i))_(j_1, ..., j_d >= 0,\ j_1 + ... + j_d = n) $
