  + Use (a) to see that
    + Exponential kernel $ K(x,y) = exp(x dot y), quad x, y in X', $
    + Gaussian kernel $ K_sigma (x,y) = exp( - (|x-y|^2)/sigma^2 ), quad x,y in X', sigma in RR, $
